# Ship and fleet events: hardware, physics, distance. One fires on most days.
# House style: content/STYLE.md.

# --- Fleet-wide -------------------------------------------------------------
card storm_shelter
type event
cat grim
days 7 24
weight 7
once
roles A
when cond A ok
when !fired h_flare
text A flare on the Sun: its protons will reach the fleet in about forty minutes. {A} packs into the storm shelter between the water tanks with a deck of cards, and every crew in the fleet does the same, cards over video, until the dosimeter settles.
do morale A 3
do var storms 1

card storm_shelter2
type event
cat grim
days 25 39
weight 7
once
roles A
when cond A ok
when var storms >= 1
text Another flare, another forty minutes between the water tanks, cards dealt for eight screens. The ground's acknowledgement lands as the dosimeters settle: next-of-kin forms, to be re-signed every ninety days "for currency". {A} signs between hands, dates it in both calendars, and deals.
do morale A 2
do var storms 1

card storm_dose
type event
cat grim
days 20 21
weight 16
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text {A} runs the dosimeter check. Every crew member is now past a hundred millisieverts, and the line is still climbing at the same slope. {A} writes it down and underlines it.
do trait A curious 1

card comm_delay
type event
cat human
days 19 21
weight 16
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text The signal delay to Earth is closing on two minutes each way. {A} sends the ground a joke and waits over three minutes to learn whether it landed. It did, on a slight delay, like everything now.
do morale A 4

card comm_delay2
type event
cat human
due
days 33 34
weight 6
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text Earth is five light-minutes away. {A} asks the ground a yes-or-no question and makes a whole cup of tea before the yes arrives, and drinks it waiting for the follow-up.
do morale A 1

# --- Hardware (controls flavor, never named) ----------------------------------
card scrubber_fault
type event
cat repair
days 6 39
weight 8
once
roles A
when res spares >= 1
when home A
when !fired crisis_air
text The CO₂ scrubber on {A}'s ship throws its fourth fault since launch. {A} fixes it, then labels it "temperamental" in permanent marker, under a label in Starbase handwriting that already says "be nice to it".
do res spares -1

card boiloff
type event
cat repair skill
days 8 36
weight 6
once
roles A
when cond A ok
when home A
text Methane boil-off on {A}'s ship runs high while it flies broadside to feed the solar wings. {A} proposes nose-to-Sun, wings canted, so the ship's own shadow falls down the tanks. The ground agrees; boil-off drops by a third, fleet-wide.
do res fuel 2
do morale A 2

# --- Hardware (mechanical flavor) --------------------------------------------
# Twin pattern: the tagged copy lets Diego draw this more often; anyone still can.
card tol_stack
type event
cat repair skill
days 6 36
weight 5
once
roles A
when cond A ok
when !fired tol_stack_m
when res spares >= 1
when home A
text A replacement pump won't sit in its mount on {A}'s ship. Every part is in tolerance. Stacked together, they're 1.4 millimeters out. {A} shims it with a washer from the spares kit and writes the stack-up on the bulkhead for the next person.
do res spares -1
do morale A 2

card tol_stack_m
type event
cat repair skill
days 6 36
weight 5
once
roles A
when cond A ok
when tag A mech
when !fired tol_stack
when res spares >= 1
when home A
text A replacement pump won't sit in its mount on {A}'s ship. Every part is in tolerance. Stacked together, they're 1.4 millimeters out. {A} shims it with a washer from the spares kit and writes the stack-up on the bulkhead for the next person.
do res spares -1
do morale A 2

# --- Rescue: CO2 scrubber failure -------------------------------------------
card crisis_air
type event
cat repair
once
days 10 36
weight 6
roles A
when cond A ok
when res spares >= 1
when home A
text The CO₂ scrubber on {A}'s ship fails outright. With one person aboard, the CO₂ climbs about a twentieth of a percent a day: not an emergency yet, the best time to fix one. {A} has the backup running in nine minutes, and it is already complaining.
do morale A -4
do open rescue_air

card rescue_air
type rescue
cat repair
duration 1
roles A B
default send
when apart B A
when cond B ok
text {A}'s ship is breathing on its backup scrubber. It needs a spare cartridge before the backup gives out.
option send | Send a cartridge | A spare cartridge rides the line across in an unscheduled crossing. {A}'s ship is breathing easy by evening.
  res spares -1
  res fuel -1
  morale A 4
option bring | {B} brings it over | {B} rides the line across with the cartridge and stays to rebuild the primary. By midnight both scrubbers run, and {B} is asleep on {A}'s floor.
  res spares -1
  res fuel -1
  move B A
  bond A B 10
  morale B 3
